      },
      "text": "\nThis group 4x4 tour crosses southwestern Bolivia to reach the Uyuni Salt Flat. Over three days, you'll see Laguna Verde and Licancabur Volcano, the Salvador Dalí Desert, the Polques hot springs, the Sol de Mañana geysers, Laguna Colorada, high-altitude lagoons, the Stone Tree, Ollagüe Volcano and the salt flat itself.\n"
